control: The workable accounts are not due before a reload has read the list, and are the latest read's failure until a later read succeeds
removes: a reload that reads the list and loads the connections leaves an earlier reload's failure in place, so the workable accounts stay that failure
packages: ./process/sessions
tests: TestTheWorkableAccountsAnswerFromTheLatestRead
scheduled-count: no
integration: yes

